{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cf321c391d00642666bf7e49c935e3951db374ad21d6ab63de608a6d74d1f93c", "ja": "（今日はPrincess公演の打ち上げ……約束どおり、\n屋上でバーベキューだ。みんな、楽しんでるな）", "zh": "（今天是Princess公演的庆功宴……\n我依约在屋顶举办烤肉大会，大家都乐在其中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "50a8ef618e9615641d45883678c20e625029ee9bf082a91afcc0efb5460a5a9b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\nバーベキュー、ちゃんと食べてるのです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了喔。\n你有吃到烤肉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c48366205d642389551affc268fe918f67fb31d18c61039474f3825e51a9a0f", "ja": "とっても美味しいお肉なのです。\n早く食べないと、なくなってしまうのですよ？", "zh": "烤肉非常好吃的唷。\n不快去吃的话，会被大家吃完的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c7f3eb04e7b5703960d48ed416fc7c76ae445c2f1ac1807d3c775e20896c2618", "ja": "……ありがとう。考えてみれば、今回まつりはずっと、\n今みたいにさりげなく、気を遣ってくれてたよな。", "zh": "……谢谢提醒。现在回想起来，这次的公演，\n茉莉总是这样若无其事地关心别人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a1ad677f874b50f9007a6cd0f38161d622e0302fa1f99d1af1b6eb0b1a75afa9", "ja": "本当に助かったよ。ありがとうな。", "zh": "你真的帮了大家很多忙，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e9466576e5bccbd466e3bcab411c6d563c3c7331cd326cf2088ea080ac62eca", "ja": "ほ？　……なんのことなのです？", "zh": "哦……这话是什么意思的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "78ff51b4e1701151485a06302ec350057a5d9d5d003dd17c213cf65390b8780c", "ja": "姫は、いつもどおりの姫だったのです。はっぴー！で、\nわんだほー！なライブがしたかっただけなのですよ。", "zh": "公主跟平常没两样的唷。\n只是想举办一场幸福美妙的演唱会而已的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "63cd7fdae0e69b04471f0877a45ab1ae190cc58a70fa499a1004032f206b0f12", "ja": "だから姫は、{$P$}さんが\n何を言っているのか、よくわからないのです。", "zh": "所以公主听不懂\n{$P$}先生讲的话是什么意思的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e8fd83d65beed997ab2ea6b6e8def309828c11519963cd9ed0e5fc3ad12965d", "ja": "そうか……そうだな、うん。\nまつりはいつもどおり、最高のお姫様だった。", "zh": "是吗……这样的话，嗯。\n茉莉，你还是跟平常一样，是最棒的公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "afce97acdce049e0e5e9cd432bd1c1e743451c813d7154b61ae0a2e4c0149533", "ja": "当然なのです！\n姫たちは、PRINCESS STARSなのですよ？", "zh": "那是当然的呀！\n公主我们可是『PRINCESS STARS』的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "b76bf2872d0c6e766ecbe5f6e66f8943878b875ef49d70cf2e1f455d1ee8e7b6", "ja": "でも……{$P$}さん。", "zh": "不过……{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0043_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "bccac7e521dd3b29b1464d4efe1e94d8bda7e63b023534d7c1768049104100d6", "ja": "……私のこと、ちゃんと見ててくれてありがとう。\n今回の合宿、本当に楽しかったよっ！", "zh": "……谢谢你一直看着我。\n这次的集训真的很开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
